#: ../../about/release-notes.md:14
msgid "ROCm 7.2.4 release notes"
msgstr "ROCm 7.2.4 发布说明"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:16
msgid ""
"ROCm 7.2.4 is a quality release focused on performance and stability "
"fixes for AI inference workloads on AMD Instinct GPUs."
msgstr ""
"ROCm 7.2.4 是一个高质量版本，主要针对 AMD Instinct GPU 上的 AI 推理工作负载进"
"行了性能和稳定性修复。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:18 ../../about/release-notes.md:183
msgid "Release highlights"
msgstr "发布亮点"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:20
msgid "The following are the notable changes in ROCm 7.2.4."
msgstr "以下是 ROCm 7.2.4 版本中的主要变更。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:22
msgid "Reduced hipGraphLaunch latency for multi-list graphs"
msgstr "降低了多列表图的 hipGraphLaunch 延迟"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:24
msgid ""
"The HIP runtime's graph dispatch mechanism has been optimized, reducing "
"launch latency for workloads using `hipGraphLaunch` with multi-list graph"
" topologies."
msgstr ""
"HIP 运行时的图调度机制已得到优化，从而降低了使用 ` hipGraphLaunch ` 且采用多"
"列表图拓扑的工作负载的启动延迟。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:26
msgid "Fixed H2D memory copy latency regression in CPX mode"
msgstr "修复了 CPX 模式下 H2D 内存复制延迟的退化问题"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:28
msgid ""
"HIP runtime synchronization behavior has been corrected on AMD Instinct "
"MI300 Series GPUs in CPX mode, restoring latency to previous levels for "
"inference workloads that run multiple HIP streams with concurrent memory "
"copies."
msgstr ""
"在 AMD Instinct MI300 系列 GPU 的 CPX 模式下，HIP 运行时同步行为已得到修正，"
"对于运行多个 HIP 流并伴有并发内存复制的推理工作负载，其延迟已恢复到先前水平。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:30
msgid "Reduced ROCprofiler-SDK profiling overhead"
msgstr "降低了 ROCprofiler-SDK 的性能分析开销"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:32
msgid ""
"Profiling stability has been improved for vLLM workloads traced with "
"PyTorch `torch.profiler` using the ROCprofiler-SDK backend. The large, "
"sporadic idle gaps that previously appeared between GPU kernels in the "
"trace have been substantially reduced in common configurations, and the "
"traces now more accurately reflect actual runtime behavior. Coverage may "
"vary depending on model and parallelism settings."
msgstr ""
"对于使用 PyTorch ` torch.profiler ` 并基于 ROCprofiler-SDK 后端进行跟踪的 "
"vLLM 工作负载，其性能分析稳定性已得到提升。在常见配置下，此前跟踪记录中 GPU "
"内核之间出现的较大且零星的空闲间隔已大幅减少，且跟踪记录现在能更准确地反映实"
"际运行时行为。 覆盖率可能因模型和并行设置的不同而有所差异。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:34
msgid "Reduced copy overhead in MIGraphX concat operations"
msgstr "降低了 MIGraphX 连接操作中的复制开销"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:36
msgid ""
"MIGraphX now recognizes ONNX models that concatenate the same tensor "
"multiple times and avoids redundant device-side copies, improving "
"inference throughput at small batch sizes for the affected model class on"
" AMD Instinct MI300X GPUs."
msgstr ""
"MIGraphX 现可识别将同一张量多次拼接的 ONNX 模型，并避免设备端冗余复制，从而"
"在 AMD Instinct MI300X GPU 上，针对受影响的模型类别，提升了小批量推理的吞吐量"
"。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:38 ../../about/release-notes.md:200
msgid "User space, driver, and firmware dependent changes"
msgstr "与用户空间、驱动程序和固件相关的更改"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:40 ../../about/release-notes.md:202
msgid ""
"The software for AMD Data Center GPU products requires maintaining a "
"hardware and software stack with interdependencies among the GPU and "
"baseboard firmware, AMD GPU drivers, and the ROCm user space software. "
"While AMD publishes drivers and ROCm user space components, your server "
"or infrastructure provider publishes the GPU and baseboard firmware by "
"bundling AMD’s firmware releases via the AMD Platform Level Data Model "
"(PLDM) bundle, which includes the Integrated Firmware Image (IFWI)."
msgstr ""
"AMD 数据中心 GPU 产品的软件需要维护一个软硬件堆栈，其中 GPU 和底板固件、AMD "
"GPU 驱动程序以及 ROCm 用户空间软件之间存在相互依赖关系。 虽然 AMD 发布驱动程"
"序和 ROCm 用户空间组件，但您的服务器或基础设施提供商会通过 AMD 平台级数据模"
"型 (PLDM) 软件包发布 GPU 和底板固件，该软件包包含集成固件映像 (IFWI)。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:44 ../../about/release-notes.md:206
msgid "GPU and baseboard firmware versioning might differ across GPU families."
msgstr "不同GPU系列之间的GPU和底板固件版本可能有所不同。"

