#: ../../about/release-notes.md:319
msgid "Improved profiling accuracy for vLLM workloads"
msgstr "提高了 vLLM 工作负载的性能分析准确性"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:321
msgid ""
"ROCm 7.2.3 improves profiling stability for vLLM workloads traced with "
"PyTorch `torch.profiler`. The large, sporadic idle gaps that previously "
"appeared between GPU kernels in the trace have been substantially reduced"
" in common configurations, and the traces now more accurately reflect "
"actual runtime behavior. Coverage may vary depending on model and "
"parallelism settings; additional improvements are in progress."
msgstr ""
"ROCm 7.2.3 提升了使用 PyTorch ` 和 torch.profiler ` 追踪 vLLM 工作负载时的性"
"能分析稳定性。 此前在跟踪记录中 GPU 内核之间出现的较大且零星的空闲间隔，在常"
"见配置下已大幅减少，且跟踪记录现在能更准确地反映实际运行时行为。覆盖率可能因"
"模型和并行设置而异；相关改进工作正在进行中。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:323
msgid "MIGraphX update"
msgstr "MIGraphX 更新"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:325
msgid ""
"[MIGraphX](https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/AMDMIGraphX/en/docs-7.2.3/index.html)"
" has the following enhancements:"
msgstr ""
"[MIGraphX](https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/AMDMIGraphX/en/docs-7.2.3/"
"index.html) 进行了以下功能增强："

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:327
msgid "Improved performance of the Gather operator"
msgstr "Gather 运算符的性能提升"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:329
msgid ""
"Performance for embedding‑heavy inference workloads is improved by "
"merging multiple independent gather operations from similar embedding "
"tables into a single batched operation. Multi‑gather workloads now run "
"more efficiently with fewer kernel launches and reduced memory traffic by"
" adding horizontal fusion for cross-embedding gather operators. These "
"gather operators have been updated to use "
"`transpose`/`reshape`/`broadcast`/`slice`, enabling better optimization "
"across different backends and data layouts."
msgstr ""
"通过将来自相似嵌入表的多个独立聚合操作合并为单个批处理操作，提升了嵌入密集型"
"推理工作负载的性能。 通过为跨嵌入聚合运算符添加水平融合，多聚合工作负载的运行"
"效率得以提升，同时减少了内核启动次数并降低了内存流量。这些聚合运算符已更新为"
"使用 ` 转置 ` / ` 重塑 ` / ` 广播 ` / ` 切片 `，从而在不同的后端和数据布局上"
"实现了更好的优化。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:331
msgid "ONNX Runtime reliability improvement"
msgstr "ONNX Runtime 可靠性提升"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:333
msgid ""
"ONNX Runtime workloads accelerated with MIGraphX now provide a more "
"reliable experience through external stream support in the MIGraphX "
"Execution Provider, with improved memory allocation and deallocation for "
"multi-stream inference."
msgstr ""
"借助 MIGraphX 加速的 ONNX Runtime 工作负载，现可通过 MIGraphX 执行提供程序对"
"外部流的支持，提供更可靠的体验，同时针对多流推理优化了内存分配和释放机制。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:335
msgid "ROCm documentation updates"
msgstr "ROCm 文档更新"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:337
msgid ""
"ROCm documentation has been updated with ROCm XIO documentation. ROCm XIO"
" provides an API for Accelerator-Initiated IO (XIO) for an AMD GPU "
"`__device__` code. It enables AMD GPUs to perform direct IO operations to"
" hardware devices without CPU intervention. ROCm XIO was initially "
"released in April 2026 as an early-access software technology preview. "
"Running production workloads is not recommended. For more information, "
"see the [ROCm XIO documentation](https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/rocm-"
"xio/en/beta-0.1.0/index.html) and {fab}`github` [ROCm/rocm-"
"xio](https://github.com/ROCm/rocm-xio) GitHub repository."
msgstr ""
"ROCm 文档已更新，新增了 ROCm XIO 文档。ROCm XIO 为 AMD GPU ` __device__ ` 代"
"码提供了加速器发起 I/O（XIO）的 API。它使 AMD GPU 能够在无需 CPU 干预的情况下"
"，直接对硬件设备执行 I/O 操作。 ROCm XIO 最初于 2026 年 4 月作为早期访问软件"
"技术预览版发布。不建议在生产环境中运行工作负载。如需了解更多信息，请参阅 "
"[ROCm XIO 文档](https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/rocm-xio/en/beta-0.1.0/"
"index.html) 以及 {fab}` github ` [ROCm/rocm-xio](https://github.com/ROCm/"
"rocm-xio) GitHub 代码库。"

