#: ../../about/release-notes.md:716
msgid "Minor performance regression for MIGraphX with int8-quantized models"
msgstr "MIGraphX 在使用 int8 量化模型时性能略有下降"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:718
msgid ""
"You might observe a slight performance regression when running "
"int8-quantized models with MIGraphX. This impact is generally minimal and"
" does not affect correctness. However, workloads sensitive to peak "
"throughput might have reduced performance when compared to non-quantized "
"or alternative execution paths. This issue is currently under "
"investigation and will be fixed in a future ROCm release. See [GitHub "
"issue #6195](https://github.com/ROCm/ROCm/issues/6195)."
msgstr ""
"在使用 MIGraphX 运行 int8 量化模型时，您可能会观察到性能出现轻微退化。这种影"
"响通常微乎其微，且不会影响结果的正确性。不过，对于对峰值吞吐量敏感的工作负载"
"而言，其性能可能会比未量化模型或替代执行路径有所下降。 该问题目前正在调查中，"
"将在未来的 ROCm 版本中修复。请参阅 [GitHub 问题 #6195](https://github.com/"
"ROCm/ROCm/issues/6195)。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:720
msgid "ROCm upcoming changes"
msgstr "ROCm 即将进行的变更"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:722
msgid ""
"The following changes to the ROCm software stack are anticipated for "
"future releases."
msgstr "预计未来版本中，ROCm 软件栈将进行以下更改。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:724
msgid "ROCTracer, ROCProfiler, rocprof, and rocprofv2 deprecation"
msgstr "ROCTracer、ROCProfiler、rocprof 和 rocprofv2 已弃用"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:726
msgid ""
"ROCTracer, ROCProfiler, `rocprof`, and `rocprofv2` are deprecated. It's "
"strongly recommended to upgrade to the latest version of the "
"[ROCprofiler-SDK](https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/rocprofiler-"
"sdk/en/latest/) library and the (`rocprofv3`) tool to ensure continued "
"support and access to new features."
msgstr ""
"ROCTracer、ROCProfiler、` rocprof ` 以及 ` rocprofv2 ` 已被废弃。 强烈建议升"
"级到最新版本的 [ROCprofiler-SDK](https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/"
"rocprofiler-sdk/en/latest/) 库和 (` rocprofv3 `) 工具，以确保持续获得支持并使"
"用新功能。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:728
msgid ""
"To learn about key feature improvements and benefits of ROCprofiler-SDK "
"over the deprecated ROCProfiler and ROCTracer, see [Comparing "
"ROCprofiler-SDK to legacy ROCm profiling "
"tools](https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/rocprofiler-"
"sdk/en/latest/conceptual/comparing-with-legacy-tools.html)."
msgstr ""
"要了解 ROCprofiler-SDK 相较于已弃用的 ROCProfiler 和 ROCTracer 在关键功能改进"
"和优势方面的信息，请参阅 [ROCprofiler-SDK 与旧版 ROCm 性能分析工具的对比]"
"(https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/rocprofiler-sdk/en/latest/conceptual/"
"comparing-with-legacy-tools.html)。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:730
msgid ""
"It's anticipated that ROCTracer, ROCProfiler, `rocprof`, and `rocprofv2` "
"will reach end of support (EoS) by the end of 2026 Q2."
msgstr ""
"预计 ROCTracer、ROCProfiler、` rocprof ` 以及 ` rocprofv2 ` 将于 2026 年第二"
"季度末停止支持（EoS）。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:732
msgid "ROCm SMI deprecation"
msgstr "ROCm SMI 已弃用"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:734
msgid ""
"[ROCm SMI](https://github.com/ROCm/rocm_smi_lib) will be phased out in an"
" upcoming ROCm release and will enter maintenance mode. After this "
"transition, only critical bug fixes will be addressed and no further "
"feature development will take place."
msgstr ""
"[ROCm SMI](https://github.com/ROCm/rocm_smi_lib) 将在即将发布的 ROCm 版本中逐"
"步淘汰，并进入维护模式。过渡完成后，仅会处理关键 bug 的修复，不再进行任何新功"
"能的开发。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:739
msgid ""
"It's strongly recommended to transition your projects to [AMD "
"SMI](https://github.com/ROCm/rocm-systems/tree/develop/projects/amdsmi), "
"the successor to ROCm SMI. AMD SMI includes all the features of the ROCm "
"SMI and will continue to receive regular updates, new functionality, and "
"ongoing support. For more information on AMD SMI, see the [AMD SMI "
"documentation](https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/amdsmi/en/latest/)."
msgstr ""
"强烈建议将您的项目迁移至 [AMD SMI](https://github.com/ROCm/rocm-systems/tree/"
"develop/projects/amdsmi)，这是 ROCm SMI 的继任者。 AMD SMI 包含 ROCm SMI 的所"
"有功能，并将持续获得定期更新、新功能以及持续的技术支持。 有关 AMD SMI 的更多"
"信息，请参阅 [AMD SMI 文档](https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/amdsmi/en/"
"latest/)。"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:745
msgid "Changes to ROCm Object Tooling"
msgstr "ROCm 对象工具集的变更"

#: ../../about/release-notes.md:747
msgid ""
"ROCm Object Tooling tools ``roc-obj-ls``, ``roc-obj-extract``, and ``roc-"
"obj`` were deprecated in ROCm 6.4, and will be removed in a future "
"release. Functionality has been added to the ``llvm-objdump "
"--offloading`` tool option to extract all clang-offload-bundles into "
"individual code objects found within the objects or executables passed as"
" input.  The ``llvm-objdump --offloading`` tool option also supports the "
"``--arch-name`` option, and only extracts code objects found with the "
"specified target architecture. See [llvm-"
"objdump](https://llvm.org/docs/CommandGuide/llvm-objdump.html) for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"ROCm 对象工具集中的工具 `` roc-obj-ls ``、`` roc-obj-extract `` 以及 `` roc-"
"obj `` 已在 ROCm 6.4 中被标记为弃用，并将在未来的版本中移除。 `` 的 llvm-"
"objdump --offloading `` 工具选项已新增功能，可将所有 clang-offload-bundles 提"
"取到作为输入传递的对象或可执行文件中发现的各个代码对象中。  工具选项 `` llvm-"
"objdump --offloading `` 还支持 `` --arch-name `` 选项，仅提取指定目标架构下的"
"代码对象。 更多信息请参阅 [llvm-objdump](https://llvm.org/docs/CommandGuide/"
"llvm-objdump.html)。"
